	(text "U10: VOUT = 1.23 V x (1 + R32 / R33) = 13.5 V, 1.6 MHz;\nnot gated by 5V_OK. C25 closes the switching loop at D6;\nC27 is 7 uF at 13.5 V (datasheet curve).\nU9: position for an open-drain voltage detector of the 803 type\n(3.08 V), not fitted. With it the converter stays off while +5V is\nbelow that level. Fit it if U10, which has no soft start, does not\nstart from the current-limited input (bench)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2e6e43c5-4226-5401-8ed9-3406c6be8325")
	)
	(text "Links for the first power-up: L1, R37, R31 and R27;\neach starts one stage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "326c31b5-4448-545d-9e28-a989b14a09e0")
	)
	(text "R37 damps the capacitors on both sides and filters the ripple: 49 kHz with C29.\nU13: VOUT = 100 uA x R38 = 12.0 V; enabled by 5V_OK (1.24 V rising).\nR39, R40 end the fast charge of C30 at 11 V; settled after 0.8 s (calculated).\nD9 clamps +12V_A near ground while -4V_A is present without it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55803536-a40e-524f-8414-ea5a538c38fd")
	)
	(text "U11: VOUT = -1.22 V x (R34 + R36) / R36 = -3.98 V.\nR30, C21 keep fast edges of +5V off the 5.8 V rating of VIN.\nR27, R28: EN = 0.6 x 5V_OK, below VIN while U11 limits its\ninput current. D8 clamps -4V_A to ground while U11 is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "95fe3681-3a1d-5541-8a7c-2b65f37863c8")
	)
	(text "U12 is supplied from +3V3_A through R31 and C20\n(3.9 kHz), so VREF is never present without the\nrail of the parts that receive it.\nD7 empties the capacitors on VREF into +3V3_A\nwhen that rail falls. R35 damps C26; it is a\ntuning position, 0 ohm to 1.5 ohm.\nC24: noise filter, 10 Hz to 20 Hz (datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e7244042-08ff-5041-a6cd-409fac83647b")
	)
